Nous Research Hermes Agent (H1 runtime guardrails, H2 context compaction, and H5 procedure playbook)

This product includes a substantial TypeScript adaptation of tool-loop guardrail concepts from Hermes Agent. Adapted behavior is implemented in:

- apps/meriv2-orchestrator/src/meri/meriv3/meriv3-run-budget.ts
- apps/meriv2-orchestrator/src/meri/meriv3/meriv3-assistant.service.ts
- apps/meriv2-orchestrator/src/meri/meriv3/openai-responses.client.ts

This product also includes a native TypeScript adaptation of context-compaction
behavior from these pinned Hermes Agent sources and tests:

- NousResearch/hermes-agent@516535b54275e963a82b4c28f866338fb768e7bc
- agent/context_compressor.py
- agent/conversation_compression.py
- NousResearch/hermes-agent@062dc1e7f0f5faa5114b4d98b94c48f5ec5df36f
- tests/agent/test_compression_adoption_preserves_live_tail.py
- tests/agent/test_compression_stall_deterministic_fallback.py
- tests/agent/test_compressor_tail_cut_tool_pair_floor.py
- tests/agent/test_context_compressor_cross_session_guard.py
- tests/agent/test_steer_compaction_persistence.py

The H2 adaptation is implemented in:

- apps/api/src/meri/meri-compaction.helpers.ts
- apps/api/src/meri/meri.service.ts
- apps/api/src/meri/meriv3-proxy.service.ts

This product also includes an H5 adaptation of evidence classification, cited
commitments, unresolved owner/date handling, modality preservation, duplicate
checks, and approval separation from these pinned Hermes Agent playbooks:

- NousResearch/hermes-agent@516535b54275e963a82b4c28f866338fb768e7bc
- skills/productivity/meeting-action-items/SKILL.md
- skills/productivity/document-to-action-items/SKILL.md

The H5 adaptation is implemented in:

- apps/api/src/meri/skills/commitments-audit.procedure.ts

Pinned acquisition and behavior mapping:

- docs/meri/implementation/acquisitions/runtime-guardrails.md
- docs/meri/implementation/acquisitions/procedure-manifests.md

This product also includes a native, concept-level TypeScript adaptation of scoped tool-selection concepts from Hermes Agent commit `516535b54275e963a82b4c28f866338fb768e7bc`, specifically `tools/tool_search.py`, `tools/tool_search_catalog.py`, and `tools/tool_search_validation.py`. No Python bridge code was copied or ported. The adapted behavior is implemented in:

- apps/meriv2-orchestrator/src/meri/meriv3/meri-semantic-tool-gateway.ts
